{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/304cd87842ec4e526050f5da88b91311.avif?t=1759988009\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kumarn: The Wandering Spirit</i></strong><i> </i>is a dark and atmospheric horror adventure inspired by chilling Thai folklore.\u00a0 You play Kumarn, a childlike spirit once worshipped at a village shrine, now torn from his sacred home and cast into a haunting world of restless ghosts and cursed places.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your loyal zebra companion, journey through forgotten temples, haunted villages and forsaken graveyards to rediscover where you truly belong.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/1ad195fef3f3ce783bbf157f6439bf85.poster.avif?t=1759988009\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/1ad195fef3f3ce783bbf157f6439bf85.webm?t=1759988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/962621691aff1a5a47d379b8b5a243cb.avif?t=1759988009\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost stories you once heard now breathe in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spirit has a story - now you\u2019re part of it.\u00a0 They mourn, they hunger, they hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now\u2026they\u2019re waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/02c16e3970f008c4fbfc81e970530bbc.poster.avif?t=1759988009\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/02c16e3970f008c4fbfc81e970530bbc.webm?t=1759988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/0bff2e73068062b95f19a3bc72fe26c1.avif?t=1759988009\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth and environmental puzzle-solving to outsmart the deadly spirits that haunt your path.\u00a0 Every step is a test of timing, precision, and courage to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/87739c7648c8b6c951b211b5aaecff5e.poster.avif?t=1759988009\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/87739c7648c8b6c951b211b5aaecff5e.webm?t=1759988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/extras/dcea19050c48cef196a92187072ea266.avif?t=1759988009\" width=1500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888420?t=1759988009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888420?t=175998800